# The touch driver hands the touch bus to the AoC on screen-off (TBN) and
# requests it back on screen-on. The AoC firmware never acknowledges this
# without Pixel's Android touch stack, so every handover waits ~3 s for a
# timeout and touch is dead after wake-up. Keep the touch ICs active instead.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="goog_touch_interface", KERNEL=="gti.*", ATTR{force_active}="1"
